    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the spring snow begins to melt, an adventurer drives to an abandoned manor deep in the forest to explore. The doors of the manor are all locked, and you must solve the puzzles to progress further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461410/extras/91c16ff1ad95d7058564ba19fd14439e.poster.avif?t=1745203324\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461410/extras/91c16ff1ad95d7058564ba19fd14439e.webm?t=1745203324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461410/extras/91c16ff1ad95d7058564ba19fd14439e.mp4?t=1745203324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mechanisms and tools in the manor are still functional. Use them to gradually uncover the secrets of the manor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461410/extras/7374a33751b79d626ba1c155686b72c2.poster.avif?t=1745203324\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461410/extras/7374a33751b79d626ba1c155686b72c2.webm?t=1745203324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461410/extras/7374a33751b79d626ba1c155686b72c2.mp4?t=1745203324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ unique box-pushing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing ambient music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The big map is connected, and puzzles are hidden between levels</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the spring snow begins to melt, an adventurer drives to an abandoned manor deep in the forest to explore. The doors of the manor are all locked, and you must solve the puzzles to progress further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461410/extras/91c16ff1ad95d7058564ba19fd14439e.poster.avif?t=1745203324\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461410/extras/91c16ff1ad95d7058564ba19fd14439e.webm?t=1745203324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461410/extras/91c16ff1ad95d7058564ba19fd14439e.mp4?t=1745203324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mechanisms and tools in the manor are still functional. Use them to gradually uncover the secrets of the manor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461410/extras/7374a33751b79d626ba1c155686b72c2.poster.avif?t=1745203324\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461410/extras/7374a33751b79d626ba1c155686b72c2.webm?t=1745203324\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3461410/extras/7374a33751b79d626ba1c155686b72c2.mp4?t=1745203324\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ unique box-pushing mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing ambient music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The big map is connected, and puzzles are hidden between levels</p></li></ul>",
